    {
      "id": "sol.amc-10a-2015-p1.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "We can evaluate it as follows. \\[\\begin{aligned} &(2^0-1+5^2+0)^{-1} \\times 5 \\\\&=\\dfrac{1}{1 - 1 + 25} \\times 5 \\\\ &= \\dfrac{5}{25}\\\\ &= \\dfrac{1}{5} \\end{aligned}\\]\n\nThus, C is the correct answer.",
